            "review_text": "Trillussinino\nEmilia-Romagna, Italy236 contributions\n0\nReal life in Hanoi\nOct 2026 • Solo\nFast, authentic, super traditional bun cha, chosen by market workers and therefore super real. At rock-bottom prices, of course if we accept the minimum survival conditions for order, cleanliness, and intimacy.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Italian\nShow original\nWritten October 2, 2026",
